<section id="about" class="py-14 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-black/70 mb-2">~/about</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl text-black leading-none">About</h2>

    <div class="font-body text-lg sm:text-xl text-black/90 leading-relaxed space-y-5 mt-8">
      <p>
        I'm Bittu, an 18-year-old software engineer and cybersecurity student at
        <a href="https://iitk.ac.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#b45309]">IIT Kanpur '30</a>.
        I work on open source, low-level systems and security, and I do freelance software work on the side.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of systems code I've spent years in the
        <a href="https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/bittu5134/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#b45309]">Minecraft technical and modding</a>
        community. One of my datapacks was featured on
        <a href="https://youtu.be/w6zLprHHZOk?t=495" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-[#b45309]">Minecraft Live</a>.
        I also build reader platforms and translation tooling for webnovels.
      </p>
      <p>
        When I'm not coding I'm watching anime, playing games, or entering game jams, hackathons and CTFs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-10">
      {% set skillsList = site.skills or techStack %}
      {% for tech in skillsList %}
        <li class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#fffdf9] border-2 border-black font-mono text-xs font-bold text-black">{{ tech.name }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
